    label: "A word before we begin",
    text: "This chronicle is told to you by me, Barradin! As befits a bard, I don't remember every detail quite exactly. And since my companions sit right beside me every time I tell it, they chime in now and then. One thing or another I may have embellished just a tiny bit ...<br>“Just a tiny bit?”"
